<title>UK: Bid defence hits Goldsborough year profit.</title>
<headline>Bid defence hits Goldsborough year profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 29</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		11.3		   vs 10.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.97		   vs 2.70</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 4.29		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.2		    vs 6.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   68.7		   vs 51.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Pre-tax profit at Goldsborough Healthcare Plc was depressed by a 1.3 million stg exceptional charge for its succesful defence against the bid earlier this year from Westminster Health Care Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
